  vignettes:
  - image: {fileID: -1075106435, guid: 522453d83bd1cf044a50cebe1de2fba5, type: 3}
    text: As well as the school, there are other worlds that are also in deep and
      disturbing darkness.
  - image: {fileID: -828262581, guid: 522453d83bd1cf044a50cebe1de2fba5, type: 3}
    text: In the most central place of knowledge, the 5 great specialities are at
      odds with each other, disturbing the primordial knowledge.
  - image: {fileID: 2012432809, guid: 522453d83bd1cf044a50cebe1de2fba5, type: 3}
    text: Faced with this disheartening situation, he seeks knowledge, located at
      the impartial nexus, called the building of critical thinkers.
  - image: {fileID: 1388162980, guid: 522453d83bd1cf044a50cebe1de2fba5, type: 3}
    text: In it, you will find what you need to enter into the different factions
      and be able to reconstruct the puzzle of humanity...  Good luck...
  nextButtonText: Next
